  "solution": "Trung điểm của đoạn thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Đường trung trực của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nhận vec-tơ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> làm vec-tơ pháp tuyến nên có phương trình<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Thay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> vào phương trình của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math>, ta nhận được <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> dần đến điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>t</mi></semantics></math> dần đến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></semantics></math>. Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra khi điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> dần đến điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> thì điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math> dần đến điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.",
